        integrity="sha384-QWTKZyjpPEjISv5WaRU9OFeRpok6YctnYmDr5pNlyT2bRjXh0JMhjY6hW+ALEwIH" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/home.css">
    <title>LoloCakes</title>
</head>

<body class="d-flex text-center text-white ">
    <div class="cover-container d-flex p-3 mx-auto flex-column">
        <nav class="navbar sticky-top navbar navbar-expand-lg bg-danger-subtle">
            <div class="container-fluid">
                <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">CakesByLolo</a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#navbarNavAltMarkup" aria-controls="navbarNavAltMarkup" aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNavAltMarkup">
                    <div class="navbar-nav">
                        <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="">Home</a>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="/products">Products</a>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="products/contact">Contacts</a>
                        <a class="nav-link" href="products/order">Place your order</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
        <main class="px-3">
            <div>
                <h2>Welcome to Lolo Cakes & Treats</h2>
                <p class="tagline"><i>A bite of deliciousness</i></p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>At Lolo Cakes & Treats, we believe that the best baked goods, yoghurts and ice creams are made
                    with
                    the same love and care you'd find in a home kitchen- and tailored to your order.Each order is
                    crafted with the thought of bringing you the warmth and comfort of homemade goodness.Using
                    time-honored recipes and fresh ingredients, we create treats that taste just like they were made
                    with love by family, for family.</p>
                <h3>Why Choose Us?</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fresh, Custom Ingredients: We hand-select the finest, locally sourced ingredients and craft
                        each
                        order specifically for you. From pastries and breads to yogurts and ice creams, everything
                        is
                        freshly prepared with your tastes in mind.</li>
                    <li>Baked and Churned on Demand: Every item—whether it's our baked goods, creamy yogurts, or
                        handcrafted ice creams—is made to order, ensuring that what you receive isn't just fresh but
                        created uniquely for you. It's like having homemade delicacies made in your own kitchen.
                    </li>
                    <li>Crafted by Hand, Inspired by Tradition: From our baked goods to our yogurts and ice creams,
                        everything is made with traditional techniques and personal care. Each creation carries the
                        warmth of homemade treats, tailored to your preferences.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Our Specialties</h3>
                <p>From the buttery flakiness of a cake to the rich, creamy delight of our house-made yoghurts and
                    ice
                    creams, every item is crafted fresh, just for you. Whether you're stopping by for a morning
                    pastry,
                    a scoop of ice cream on a sunny afternoon, or ordering a custom cake or yoghurt for a special
                    event,
                    we ensure each product is prepared with care and attention. Your order is never pre-made, always
                    crafted just in time for your enjoyment.</p>
                <h3>Visit Us</h3>
                <p>Come in and place your order—whether it's a warm, freshly baked treat, a refreshing scoop of
                    homemade
                    ice cream, or creamy yogurt, we'll make something special just for you. Our bakery is where
                    fresh
                    flavors and family-inspired care come together.</p>
                <h3>Order from Our Kitchen to Yours</h3>
                <p>Can't make it in? No worries! You can still enjoy our fresh baked goods, yogurts, and ice creams
                    by
                    ordering online. Every item is made to order, ensuring that what you receive is crafted
                    especially
                    for you.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/products" class="btn btn-primary active">View products</a>
        </main>

        <footer class="mt-auto text-white-50">
            <p class="copyright">&copy; CakesByLolo</p>
        </footer>

    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bs-custom-file-input/dist/bs-custom-file-input.min.js"></script>
